[Message: Jailbirds, thank you for coming to my 3rd BIRTHDAY HERE in hololive! You've truly made the last few years of my life so incredibly memorable. I can't wait to see where this next year of my life with Advent, hololive, and you takes me! Thanks for always supporting me, and let's keep doing our best!!! -Nerissa]

